cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Household Energy ABM (SPDT): hour-by-hour residential energy demand for GeoJSON neighbourhoods"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based model that simulates hour-by-hour residential
  electricity and gas demand for every dwelling in a GeoJSON
  neighbourhood, SERL-calibrated and validated against DESNZ
  subnational consumption (2020-2023), with policy levers for
  heat-pumps, retrofits, and socio-demographic targeting.
type: software
authors:
